        "summary": "Get Report Url Detail",
        "description": "Per-URL detail: AI analysis verbatim + structured_data + screenshot\ninventory (the actual bytes come from the SCREENSHOT route).",
        "operationId": "get_report_url_detail_api_reports__date___run_id__url_get",
